[2m│[0m [1m[38;5;231mWhat tooling should I set up from the start? Cheapest now, before any code exists.[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Unit tests
  [38;5;246mA test runner plus a first passing test. Note: this is the one item that requires adding Node/npm to a currently [39m
  [38;5;246mzero-dependency repo.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Lint + format
  [38;5;246mESLint + Prettier with autoformat. Also requires npm. Keeps style decisions out of every future diff.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright driving a real browser. Highest value for a DOM-heavy app, heaviest dependency.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] None — keep it zero-dependency
  [38;5;246mNo package.json at all. Preserves 'open index.html and it works' completely; testing is manual.[39m
